  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A photon of frequency <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span> scatters off a stationary electron. </p>\n<p>What type of energy is gained by the electron and what is true about the frequency of the photon after the scattering?</p>\n\n<table>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Type of energy gained by the electron</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p><strong>Frequency of the photon after the scattering</strong></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"A\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>A.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>light energy</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Greater than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"B\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>B.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>kinetic energy</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Greater than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"C\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>C.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>light energy</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Less than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr data-label=\"D\">\n<td>\n<p><strong>D.</strong></p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>kinetic energy</p>\n</td>\n<td>\n<p>Less than <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"f\"></span></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>"
